    {
        "name": "Legg-Calve-Perthes Disease",
        "name_ja": "レッグ・カルベ・ペルテス病",
        "symptoms": {"limping_rl", "limping_rr", "pain_on_touch", "reluctance_move", "stiffness"},
        "description": "Avascular necrosis of the femoral head in young small-breed dogs (4-11 months), causing progressive hip pain, lameness, and femoral head collapse. Unilateral in most cases. Surgical femoral head and neck excision (FHNE) is curative.",
        "description_ja": "若齢小型犬（4〜11ヶ月齢）の大腿骨頭の無腐性壊死。進行性股関節痛・跛行・大腿骨頭崩壊を引き起こす。片側性が大半。大腿骨頭頸部切除術（FHNE）が根治的。",
        "pathophysiology": "Disruption of blood supply to the femoral head → avascular necrosis of subchondral bone → femoral head collapse and deformation → hip joint incongruity → secondary OA and chronic pain. Cause of ischemia unknown (possibly genetic vascular abnormality). Self-limiting remodeling occurs but with permanent deformity without surgery.",
        "pathophysiology_ja": "大腿骨頭への血流障害→軟骨下骨の無腐性壊死→大腿骨頭の崩壊・変形→股関節の不整合→二次性OA・慢性疼痛。虚血の原因は不明（遺伝的血管異常が疑われる）。手術なしでもリモデリングは起こるが永続的変形が残る。",
        "causes": "Unknown etiology; genetic predisposition likely. Predisposed breeds: Toy Poodle, Miniature Pinscher, Yorkshire Terrier, West Highland White Terrier, Cairn Terrier, Pug, Chihuahua. Age of onset: 4-11 months. Typically unilateral (10-15% bilateral).",
        "causes_ja": "原因不明。遺伝的素因あり。好発犬種：トイプードル、ミニチュアピンシャー、ヨークシャーテリア、WHWT、ケアーンテリア、パグ、チワワ。発症月齢：4〜11ヶ月。通常片側性（10〜15%両側性）。",
        "recommended_tests": [
            "Hip radiographs (VD extended view + frog-leg lateral): femoral head flattening, rarefaction, subchondral sclerosis, femoral neck shortening, irregular joint space — changes may lag 2-4 weeks behind clinical signs",
            "CT scan: earlier detection of subchondral bone changes, precise extent of necrosis — useful when radiographs equivocal",
            "MRI: most sensitive for early avascular necrosis — T1 hypointense/T2 hyperintense signal in femoral head before radiographic changes",
            "Orthopedic exam under sedation: reduced hip ROM, pain on internal rotation and abduction, crepitus in advanced cases, thigh muscle atrophy",
            "Comparison of bilateral hip radiographs: contralateral hip for 10-15% bilateral cases",
        ],
        "treatment": "Surgical — femoral head and neck excision (FHNE): definitive treatment. Remove entire femoral head and neck to eliminate bone-on-bone pain; pseudoarthrosis ('false joint') forms with surrounding muscle. Outcomes excellent in small dogs (<10 kg): 85-95% return to near-normal function with intensive physiotherapy. Total hip replacement (THR): an option in larger small-breed dogs for superior biomechanics. Post-FHNE rehabilitation (critical for outcome): immediate weight-bearing encouraged from day 1; passive ROM exercises BID; underwater treadmill/swimming from week 2; progressive land exercises weeks 3-8; full function expected by 3-4 months. Peri-operative NSAIDs: carprofen 4.4 mg/kg SID or meloxicam 0.1 mg/kg SID for 7-14 days. Gabapentin 5-10 mg/kg BID for post-surgical neuropathic pain. Conservative management (early Stage I-II, pending surgery): strict cage rest, NSAIDs, analgesics — rarely curative, used only as bridge to surgery.",
        "treatment_ja": "外科的：大腿骨頭頸部切除術（FHNE）が根治的治療。大腿骨頭・頸部を完全切除し骨同士の接触による疼痛を除去。周囲筋肉による偽関節（false joint）が形成される。小型犬（<10 kg）での成績は優良：集中的理学療法で85〜95%がほぼ正常機能に回復。より大きな小型犬では人工股関節（THR）も選択肢。術後リハビリ（予後に決定的）：術翌日から歩行促進、受動的ROM運動1日2回、水中トレッドミル/水泳2週目〜、陸上漸進運動3〜8週、3〜4ヶ月で全機能回復。NSAIDs：カルプロフェン4.4 mg/kg SID（7〜14日）。ガバペンチン5〜10 mg/kg BID（術後神経障害性疼痛）。保存療法（初期Stage I〜II、手術待機中）：厳格な安静・NSAIDs・鎮痛—単独では根治しない（手術待機中の橋渡しとして使用）。",
        "prognosis": "Excellent with FHNE + intensive rehabilitation in dogs <10 kg: 85-95% return to near-normal function. Larger dogs may have residual gait abnormalities; THR preferred. Without surgery: permanent femoral head deformity → chronic pain → poor long-term QOL. Delay increases muscle atrophy and recovery time.",
        "prognosis_ja": "FHNE＋集中的リハビリで<10 kgの犬は85〜95%がほぼ正常機能に回復。体重が大きい場合は残存する跛行あり（THRが優先）。手術なし：大腿骨頭の永続的変形→慢性疼痛→長期的なQOL不良。手術遅延は筋萎縮を進行させ回復を困難にする。",
        "prevention": "Breeding management: exclude affected dogs from breeding (genetic component). No environmental prevention possible. Early veterinary evaluation of limping small-breed puppies (3-12 months) is key for early diagnosis and surgical timing.",
        "prevention_ja": "繁殖管理：罹患犬を繁殖から除外（遺伝的要因）。環境的予防法はない。跛行を示す小型子犬（3〜12ヶ月）の早期受診が早期診断と最適な手術時期の確保に重要。",
        "urgency": "normal",
    },
